==Battleground==
*20 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**15 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
It helps a lot to have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], as he is cheap, has high health, good DPS and counters Angel enemies. Bring him along some attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and/or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to easily deal with this stage.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Most Ubers from the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]] banner are very helpful here, as they tend to target Angel enemies.

